msgstr ""
"The engine version nke thesis na-azọpụta ndị a ụkpụrụ, ma mgbe optimizing ọ "
"mgbe niile na-eji bi 100, 20 ọgbọ, crossover 0.8, na mutation 0.2. The mma "
"version nke engine ga-eji ha."

